8.2. Muhim jadvallarning batafsil tuzilishi
Quyidagi sxema dasturchilar uchun boshlang‘ich relatsion modeldir. UUID identifikatorlari, TIMESTAMPTZ vaqt maydonlari va aniq cheklovlar qo‘llanadi.

A. organizations — tashkilotlar
CREATE TABLE organizations (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    parent_id UUID REFERENCES organizations(id),
    code VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    name VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    organization_type VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    status VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'ACTIVE',
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);


B. users — tizim akkauntlari
CREATE TABLE users (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    employee_id UUID NOT NULL,
    username VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    password_hash TEXT NOT NULL,
    status VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PENDING',
    failed_login_count INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
    locked_until TIMESTAMPTZ,
    password_changed_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);


C. tasks — topshiriqlar
CREATE TABLE tasks (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    task_number VARCHAR(40) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    title VARCHAR(500) NOT NULL,
    description TEXT NOT NULL,
    source_document_id UUID,
    organization_id UUID NOT NULL,
    territory_id UUID,
    parent_task_id UUID,
    source_communication_id UUID,
    priority VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
    confidentiality VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL,
    status VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL,
    expected_result TEXT NOT NULL,
    start_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    deadline_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    completed_at TIMESTAMPTZ,
    created_by UUID NOT NULL,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),
    updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);


D. task_actors — topshiriqdagi vakolatlar
CREATE TABLE task_actors (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    task_id UUID NOT NULL,
    user_id UUID NOT NULL,
    actor_role VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL,
    assigned_by UUID NOT NULL,
    valid_from TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,
    valid_to TIMESTAMPTZ,
    is_active BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT TRUE,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);


actor_role quyidagi qiymatlarni oladi:
- CREATOR
- ASSIGNER
- RESPONSIBLE
- ASSIGNEE
- REVIEWER
- APPROVER
- OBSERVER
- CO_ASSIGNEE
Bitta topshiriqda bir nechta ijrochi bo‘lishi mumkin. Lekin yakuniy tasdiqlovchi va reviewer rollari uchun tegishli siyosat bo‘yicha yagona faol vakil belgilanadi. Bir nechta tasdiqlovchi zarur bo‘lsa, alohida ketma-ket yoki parallel approval bosqichlari modeli qo‘llanadi.

E. task_status_history — holat o‘zgarishi
CREATE TABLE task_status_history (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    task_id UUID NOT NULL,
    from_status VARCHAR(30),
    to_status VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL,
    changed_by UUID NOT NULL,
    reason TEXT,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);


F. reviews — tekshiruv xulosasi
CREATE TABLE reviews (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    task_id UUID NOT NULL,
    reviewer_id UUID NOT NULL,
    decision VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL,
    comment TEXT NOT NULL,
    reviewed_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);


G. approvals — yakuniy qaror
CREATE TABLE approvals (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    task_id UUID NOT NULL,
    approver_id UUID NOT NULL,
    decision VARCHAR(30) NOT NULL,
    comment TEXT,
    approved_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);


H. audit_events — audit jurnali
CREATE TABLE audit_events (
    id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    actor_id UUID,
    action VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    object_type VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    object_id UUID,
    old_value JSONB,
    new_value JSONB,
    reason TEXT,
    result VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
    ip_address INET,
    session_id UUID,
    correlation_id UUID,
    created_at TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);


Bu SQL namunaviy boshlang‘ich sxema. Ishlab chiqarish uchun qo‘shimcha foreign key, check constraint, indeks, partition, ma’lumotlarni saqlash muddati va migration skriptlari ishlab chiqilishi shart.
